    "Description": "rhc is a client tool and daemon that connects the system to Red Hat hosted services enabling system and subscription management.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* net/http: golang: golang: Denial of Service via crafted HTTP Range headers (CVE-2026-78667)\n\n* crypto/tls: golang: crypto/tls: Denial of Service via multiple ECH outer extension references (CVE-2026-97031)\n\n* net/http: net/http/internal/http2: golang.org/x/net/http2: net/http: Denial of Service via excessive HTTP/2 SETTINGS frames (CVE-2026-78669)\n\n* crypto/x509: golang: crypto/x509: Man-in-the-middle attacks via untrusted intermediate certificates (CVE-2026-111943)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
